{"path":"io/basic_iostream/operator=","title":"std::basic_iostream<CharT,Traits>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_iostream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_iostream/operator=","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Assigns another stream object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_iostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> basic_iostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> delete<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br>basic_iostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> basic_iostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assigns another stream object.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Copy assignment is not allowed.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Move assigns another stream object. Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span>rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. This move assignment operator is protected: it is called by the move assignment operators of the derived stream classes <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_stringstream\">std::basic_stringstream</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream\">std::basic_fstream</a></span> which know how to properly move-assign the associated stream buffers.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  another stream to assign state of\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_iostream/basic_iostream\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs the object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_iostream","title":"std::basic_iostream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_iostream<CharT,Traits>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Assigns another stream object."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs the object"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":89,"codeBlockCount":0}
